# Anything pulled out of the patient database. Today every patient is fake, so the case files
# already committed are harmless. The first time a real child's words land in one of these, they
# are in the repository permanently and cannot be taken back out — so the rule exists before the
# first real patient does, not after.
#
# If you need to share a case set, share the LINK to a review round (see AI-dev/scripts/), not the
# file. See docs/backlog.md, HIPAA item 6.
AI-dev/**/cases_review.json
AI-dev/**/review_sheet_source.json
AI-dev/**/harvested_*.json
